Kemari.

01:49:21.421 --> 01:49:22.856
Kemari.

01:49:54.120 --> 01:51:16.002
Gerak sendiri. Apa yang kena?

01:51:52.138 --> 01:51:53.339
Gerakkan dirimu sendiri.

01:52:16.596 --> 01:52:18.398
